<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Odebrecht plans global offering.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Odebrecht plans global offering.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian petrochemical and construction conglomerate Odebrecht SA said it plans to issue preferred shares in the form of Depositary Receipts in U.S., European and Asian markets sometime in the third quarter.</p>
<p>In a statement published in local newspapers, Odebrecht said the terms and conditions of the issue would be released when the deal was registered.  It did not say how much the company planned to raise from the deal.</p>
<p>Odebrecht officials were not available to comment on the statement.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
